From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:10:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Double tap to sleep: time the second tap, not both

GestureDetector calls onDoubleTap with the first tap's down event, so the 300 ms limit covered the whole double tap and
only very fast ones counted. It now starts at the second tap's down event, as it was meant to.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A7tdbTAv6xiqf4SbJWNdwp

